# Factory reset creates new node identity and new sequence lifetime
name: factory-reset
version: 1
description: Factory reset generates new node_id, new incarnation, resets sequence to 1.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
read CHIP-002
assert observations 2
assert next_sequence 3
factory_reset
assert observations 0
assert next_sequence 1
assert node_id changed
assert incarnation changed
read CHIP-003
assert observations 1
assert next_sequence 2
assert observation 0 sequence 1
assert observation 0 chip_id CHIP-003
reboot
assert node_id unchanged
assert next_sequence 2
assert observations 1
read CHIP-004
assert observations 2
assert next_sequence 3